## 📌 Project Overview
This project is a complete, production-ready Machine Learning pipeline designed to predict daily energy consumption based on weather data (Temperature, Humidity) and calendar events (Weekends/Months). 

Unlike a standard Jupyter Notebook project, this application is built using a **Microservices Architecture**. It separates the Machine Learning model, the Backend API, and the Frontend UI into independent, scalable components.

